feat(web): arrange projects by dragging them in the Projects sidebar

Drag a project row (or Alt+Up/Down on it) to move it. The move pins the
project, and any project shown above it, at that spot with the same pin
order keys threads use, so the list reads as dropped on every client.
Unpin returns a project to automatic order.

